# item art contact sheets — the SOURCE PNGs Jordan generates in ChatGPT, ~59 MB.
# The id lists (sheets/*.txt) ARE committed: they are the reading-order contract
# cutall.js slices against. The images are not, because this repo is what GitHub
# Pages deploys and 59 MB would slow every deploy for the life of the project.
# Master copies live in Desktop/cindervale icons — back that folder up, it is the
# only place they exist.
_iconart/sheets/*.png
_iconart/sheets/_*.txt

# item art working dirs — all derived from sheets/ by cutall.js + key.js, ~270 MB
